Output docs/demos/out/symbols-terminal.webm
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1400
Set Height 800
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Type~ "nvim -n -i NONE docs/demos/isle/tour/tour.isle"
Enter
Hide
Sleep 2500ms
Show
Sleep 1000ms
Type " S"
Sleep 2500ms
Type~ "lower"
Sleep 2500ms
Escape
Sleep 800ms
Type " s"
Sleep 1500ms
Type~ "emit"
Sleep 2500ms
